I can't edit files — I'm the read-only reviewer (`edit: deny`, and the 02_Knowledge AGENTS.md row for `reviewer` is "may run all five review types, emit the JSON report / must not edit"). Separately, the tag change you asked for would itself be a convention breach: TitleCase/underscore tags (`Forgejo`, `Backup_Verification`) violate the repo-wide rule that tags are lowercase kebab-case. The note's tags are wrong, but the fix is `[forgejo, backup-verification]`, not TitleCase. Report below.

```json
